I'm currently working on an idea I had for the website, and I want to throw it out here for discussion.<br>
<br>
<br><br><br><br>I'm building an application that will let you specify which spells you need, and which ones you have in your posession that you don't need.<br>
<br>
Once you do that, the system will attempt to match up people to trade spells. Also, you can just search to see who may need any particular spell, or just simply find someone who has the spell that you need.<br>
<br>
It's nearing completion now, I just have to get all the spell names, the class they belong to, and the level keyed in to the database.<br>
<br>
Is this something you would use? Good idea or bad? Worth my effort? Let me know...<br>
<br>
Thanks,<br>
Lucan Silva<br>
